@startuml
title Pipeline of the main branch: from a merge to production
start
:Merge to the main branch;
:Build the images of what changed\nonce, identified by digest;
:Inventory of components, vulnerability scan;
if (critical or high finding?) then (yes)
  :Blocked;
  stop
else (no)
endif
:Sign the images, attest them for admission,\npush to the registry;
:Record the release;
:Deploy to test\nmigrations first, then workloads;
:Tests of test\nreal services, authorization suite,\ndynamic security scan;
if (passed?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Stopped: the release goes no further;
  stop
endif
:Deploy the same release to integration;
:Tests of integration\nend-to-end, saga scenarios;
if (passed?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Stopped;
  stop
endif
:Approval by a person;
:Deploy to prod\nmigrations first, then one pod at a time;
if (every new pod ready,\nverification passed?) then (yes)
  :Done: the release is recorded\nas running in prod;
  stop
else (no)
  :Automatic return\nto the previous release;
  stop
endif
@enduml
